<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-L.LEASE SEES 97/97 PROFIT, DIV RISE.</title>
<headline>RTRS-L.LEASE SEES 97/97 PROFIT, DIV RISE.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property and financial services group Lend Lease Corp said on Thursday it expected a higher net profit, earnings per share and dividend payment in the year to June 30, 1998.</p>
</text>
